{"id":"9b3d91c91ef33900","group":"91","path":"91/91-fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference.md","title":"fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference — 逐句去引号与闭项统一去引号","display":"fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference — 逐句去引号与闭项统一去引号","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference","aliases":["91-fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference"],"display":"fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference — 逐句去引号与闭项统一去引号","depends_on":["[[91-df-TB]]","[[91-df-UTB]]","[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference — 逐句去引号与闭项统一去引号"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTm}\">\\(\\mathrm{CTm}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a> 的闭项编码域。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UTBic}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{UTBic}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\\)</span> 分别是 TB、UTB 的去引号公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UTBic}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\operatorname{UTBic}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> 在此采用闭项版本。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(\\vec x)\">\\(\\theta(\\vec x)\\)</span> 是固定标准基础公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}\">\\(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}\\)</span> 为同步闭项代入编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}\\)</span> 为闭项取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}TB\\text{-}UTB\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}difference}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)=\\{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}TB\\text{-}UTB\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}difference}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)=\\{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UTBic}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)=\\left\\{\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{CTm}\\,\n\\left[T(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},\\vec t))\\leftrightarrow\\theta(\\operatorname{val}(\\vec t))\\right]:\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{\\vec x\\}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{UTBic}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)=\\left\\{\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{CTm}\\,\n\\left[T(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},\\vec t))\\leftrightarrow\\theta(\\operatorname{val}(\\vec t))\\right]:\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{\\vec x\\}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>UTB 在固定矩阵内对所有闭项编码作对象量化；数字代入是它的特例。旧稿仅列数字统一双条件，原书页 54 明确指出那一版本较弱，不能用它替代 Definition 7.2。\n两个公理集均为元层模式；它们没有在对象语言中量化“标准公式”。TB、UTB 还都含完整 PA_T 归纳，且仍对 PA 算术保守。U 表示 uniform，不表示对含 T 的所有句子去引号。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 7.1–7.3，印刷页 53–55，PDF 页 64–66；Theorem 7.5。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CTm}$ 为 [[91-df-coded-syntax]] 的闭项编码域。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UTBic}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UTBic}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}TB\\text{-}UTB\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}difference}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)=\\{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UTBic}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)=\\left\\{\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{CTm}\\,\n\\left[T(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},\\vec t))\\leftrightarrow\\theta(\\operatorname{val}(\\vec t))\\right]:\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{\\vec x\\}\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1925,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-208","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-208","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-fact-TB-UTB-axiom-difference]]"}],"outgoing":["6018cc1b13710826","2f215d3f10d33ae6","38c875c58a0bf84c"]}